ut weakening their existing [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]reliability guarantees.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]powerful_variables.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/powerful_variables.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-mg[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-mg/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add an indexed output-variable query contract to sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-variable-index[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-variable-index: project stored output variables into the agent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifact index and expose typed, deterministic history queries through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Rust and PyO3.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Replace current-agent list with show and build historical list[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]show-and-list-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-variable-index[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]show-and-list-cli: add the show command, redesign list around the core [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]history query, and provide rich and machine-readable output with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filtering and limits.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add the variable selector language and get command[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]selector-get-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after show-and-list-cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]selector-get-cli: implement exact, global, hood, key-wildcard, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON-path selectors with predictable output for humans, shells, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agents.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Synchronize the sase_var skill and verify the complete [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]workflow[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]skill-and-integration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after selector-get-cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]skill-and-integration: teach agents only the new show replacement, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exercise end-to-end behavior, and run repository-wide verification [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]without exposing historical discovery in the skill yet.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-mg","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-mg.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8b08119b6bfaa04d60a17b521cde98b6","started_at":"2026-08-15T19:39:13.381327+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"45819367fc1d580c5670910c726322419768ff712af2ea7582533e2f858b0401","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mg.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"c646096e80fef13e519897a7bd7c5e2fa0fbf60f17f5a40e0560e57c2272924c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mg.4/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"47f071806f358a38dff6073b959013862f25bdff7ca6753b16608f8bac751113","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mg.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":147},"state":{"digest":"e60a13f864aeb4742c08f5706aa26b5fce84356d1d6e425511dac547c833f7b4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mg.4/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-mg.4","local_name":"sase-mg.4","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-mg","agent_clan_generation":"20260815153853","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-mg.4","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_trib